{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And he said.</b> Aaron was not prophesying, for there was no need, since Moses is the one sent to Pharaoh, and Aaron had been sent previously to Israel, and Miriam to the women. Therefore it says, \"And I sent before you Moses, Aaron, and Miriam\" (Micah 6:4)." "<b>The mountain of Elohim.</b> It is Horeb."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "Resolved ע\"כ as על כן ('therefore') based on context."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:42.641389686Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}